digraph result {
  bgcolor="white"; nodesep=0.8; ranksep=1.0;
  labelloc="b"; fontname="Helvetica"; fontsize=14; fontcolor="#b5473a";
  label=<<br/><b>Step 2, 40 runs per condition.</b> Both ends are connected; the proposed mediator does not carry it.<br/><font point-size="12" color="#8a9099">solid = interval excludes zero&#160;&#160;&#183;&#160;&#160;dotted = interval contains zero</font>>;
